# P1 — correctness / race conditions

## 41. Fix the duplicate-file collision bug

This one is concrete.

`file_duplicate()` tries:

```text
copy
copy 2
...
copy 100
```

and stops checking after 100.

If `(copy 100)` already exists, it can then copy onto that existing destination.

That's the wrong behavior.

### Fix

Use atomic creation:

```text
create_new
```

or an equivalent exclusive-create mechanism.

No arbitrary 100-copy limit.

